      "text": "\\[\\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{x^{2^n} - x^{-2^n}} = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{x^{2^n} - x^{-2^n}} \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}}} + \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}}}\\right) \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\left( \\cfrac{x^{2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}}} + \\cfrac{x^{2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n} }}\\right) \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}}}{(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}})} + \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n} }}{(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}})} \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}}} + \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}}}. \\]\n\n\nThus, $\\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\left( x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}}\\right) = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}}} + \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}}}{x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}}} \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\cfrac{(x^{2^{n + 1}} + x^{-2^{n + 1}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})}{(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})} + \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\cfrac{(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})}{(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n + 1}})(x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}})} \\\\ = \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{4^{n + 1}} - x^{-4^{n + 1}}}  {6 (x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}})^2} + \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{x^{4^{n + 1}} - x^{-4^{n + 1}}}  {6 (x^{2^{n + 1}} - x^{-2^{n}})^2} \\\\ = \\\\ \\boxed{\\frac{1}{x - 1}} \\]",
